menu "BQ27220 Configuration"

    config BQ27220_SEAL_SETTLE_MS
        int "Seal confirmation timeout (ms)"
        range 0 10000
        default 2000
        help
            Maximum time to wait for OperationStatus()[SEC] to report SEALED after sending the SEALED subcommand.
            The driver returns as soon as SEALED is confirmed, and returns immediately if the gauge is already sealed.

endmenu
